--- !u!114 &80352293
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 80352287}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd54c1448c7205f4aa14f33523306ba4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  briefingTexts:
  - 'Agent... It seems the time has come. Our worst fears have been realized...

'
  - "We\u2019ve made first contact with an alien civilization. Much to our dismay,
    they do not come in peace."
  - "The skies are swarming with UFOs, beaming down armies of aliens. The world as
    we know it is no more. But that's where you come in agent\u2026"
  - "Thanks to the genius of Dr. Looppenheimer, we\u2019ve equipped your car with
    the LOOPHOLE APPARATUS."
  - The experimental and highly volatile LOOPHOLE APPARATUS uses energy to carve
    a path of pure entropy into the earth.
  - Use it to draw a closed circle, and it will open a supercharged quantum loophole.
  - Anything inside that loophole gets converted to pure energy, especially visitors
    of the extraterrestrial variety...
  - Careful though, using the device drains energy, and once you run out, you're
    a sitting duck...
  - ... Agent... You are our last hope. Use the LOOPHOLE APPARATUS to liberate the
    city from the invasion.
  - We are all depending on you... Good Luck.
  textBox: {fileID: 637742729}
  menuScript: {fileID: 80352292}
